  "conclusions": [
    "All six selected declarations are protected. Validate and MoveChildren take required pointers, not default or optional arguments.",
    "HasOnlyPhantoms dispatches through GetChildCount, checking one child before empty; descendant recursion only for a phantom.",
    "Counted-parent dispatch checks parent IsPhantom before its counted policy; direct root ancestors return true without parent policy reads.",
    "MoveChildren selects an empty destination factory or existing tail; a null destination is untouched only on the empty-source release body. DBG_UTIL sanity still dereferences destination.",
    "Native empty phantom lookup and nonempty-null transfer are outside valid domain; no fallback or tests for undefined behavior."
